    rather than as a capability refusal - the two point in opposite directions.
  * SM225 describe_capabilities carries a documentation index, derived from what
    the site publishes; a /docs/ index page ships with it.
  * SM226 the capability map states its own scope: a false means "not granted to
    this account", never "not available", and a granted channel whose site
    service is off is reported as dormant.
