    the translate-values-not-keys rule. Engine-chrome localisation deferred.
  * EDGE: SM177 - theme/layout delete-safety scans every registered domain (base +
    sub-domains), resolving effective values, and refuses while any domain uses the
    artifact (previously only the primary's active choice was considered).
